denied payment for the MRI of the lumbar spine (CPT 72148) because the service was\nnot medically necessary. Our reviewer found that your records did not show six weeks of\nconservative treatment, such as physical therapy, before imaging was ordered.", "lines": [{"bbox": [72.0, 303.97, 497.74, 313.97], "start": 0, "end": 90}, {"bbox": [72.0, 316.97, 463.26, 326.97], "start": 91, "end": 178}, {"bbox": [72.0, 329.97, 420.48, 339.97], "start": 179, "end": 256}], "kind": "paragraph"}, {"clause_id": "synthetic-denial-ambetter-tx#p1.14", "doc_id": "synthetic-denial-ambetter-tx", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 348.97, 458.84, 371.97], "text": "Denial code CO-50: the service is not covered because it was not found to be medically\nnecessary.", "lines": [{"bbox": [72.0, 348.97, 458.84, 358.97], "start": 0, "end": 86}, {"bbox": [72.0, 361.97, 120.35, 371.97], "start": 87, "end": 97}], "kind": "paragraph"}, {"clause_id": "synthetic-denial-ambetter-tx#p1.15", "doc_id": "synthetic-denial-ambetter-tx", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 380.97, 451.83, 403.97], "text": "You may ask for a copy of the clinical criteria and the reviewer's clinical rationale used\nin this decision, free of charge.", "lines": [{"bbox": [72.0, 380.97, 451.83, 390.97], "start": 0, "end": 90}, {"bbox": [72.0, 393.97, 207.62, 403.97], "start": 91, "end": 124}], "kind": "paragraph"}, {"clause_id": "synthetic-denial-ambetter-tx#p1.16", "doc_id": "synthetic-denial-ambetter-tx", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 412.97, 468.87, 435.97], "text": "You may request the diagnosis code and the treatment code for this claim, and what each\ncode means, at no cost.", "lines": [{"bbox": [72.0, 412.97, 468.87, 422.97], "start": 0, "end": 87}, {"bbox": [72.0, 425.97, 178.17, 435.97], "start": 88, "end": 111}], "kind": "paragraph"}, {"clause_id": "synthetic-denial-ambetter-tx#p1.17", "doc_id": "synthetic-denial-ambetter-tx", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 445.18, 168.58, 456.18], "text": "Your appeal rights", "lines": [{"bbox": [72.0, 445.18, 168.58, 456.18], "start": 0, "end": 18}], "kind": "paragraph"}, {"clause_id": "synthetic-denial-ambetter-tx#p1.18", "doc_id": "synthetic-denial-ambetter-tx", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 469.27, 466.64, 505.27], "text": "You or someone you name to act for you may file an internal appeal within 180 days after\nyou receive this notice. We will decide a post-service appeal within 30 calendar days\nafter we receive it.", "lines": [{"bbox": [72.0, 469.27, 466.64, 479.27], "start": 0, "end": 88}, {"bbox": [72.0, 482.27, 445.48, 492.27], "start": 89, "end": 174}, {"bbox": [72.0, 495.27, 153.14, 505.27], "start": 175, "end": 195}], "kind": "paragraph"}, {"clause_id": "synthetic-denial-ambetter-tx#p1.19", "doc_id": "synthetic-denial-ambetter-tx", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 514.27, 473.32, 550.27], "text": "To start an appeal, send a written request and any records that support it to Member\nAppeals Unit, PO Box 0000, Austin, TX 78700. If we uphold this denial, you may ask for an\nexternal review by an Independent Review Organization that is not part of your plan.", "lines": [{"bbox": [72.0, 514.27, 444.96, 524.27], "start": 0, "end": 84}, {"bbox": [72.0, 527.27, 473.32, 537.27], "start": 85, "end": 174}, {"bbox": [72.0, 540.27, 443.85, 550.27], "start": 175, "end": 259}], "kind": "paragraph"}, {"clause_id": "synthetic-denial-ambetter-tx#p1.20", "doc_id": "synthetic-denial-ambetter-tx", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 559.27, 443.84, 582.27], "text": "For free help with your appeal, you may contact the consumer help line of the Texas\nDepartment of Insurance.", "lines": [{"bbox": [72.0, 559.27, 443.84, 569.27], "start": 0, "end": 83}, {"bbox": [72.0, 572.27, 184.83, 582.27], "start": 84, "end": 108}], "kind": "paragraph"}, {"clause_id": "synthetic-denial-ambetter-tx#p1.21", "doc_id": "synthetic-denial-ambetter-tx", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 751.66, 242.3, 759.66], "text": "Synthetic · synthetic-denial-ambetter-tx Page 1", "lines": [{"bbox": [72.0, 751.66, 242.3, 759.66], "start": 0, "end": 